  <uml:Model xmi:id="_EbqrYPxDEfCigOOGci6CAw" name="mango">
    <eAnnotations xmi:id="_EbtHoPxDEfCigOOGci6CAw" source="Objing">
      <contents xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="_EbtHofxDEfCigOOGci6CAw" name="exporterVersion">
        <defaultValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralString" xmi:id="_EbtusPxDEfCigOOGci6CAw" value="3.0.0"/>
      </contents>
    </eAnnotations>
    <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_EbtusfxDEfCigOOGci6CAw">
      <body>The purpose of MANGO is to provide a higher level of description for multi-attribute properties.
When used with MIVOT annotations, it enables tabular data to be represented as structured objects.
This enables the metadata representation to be improved and complex quantities to be reconstructed from column values. Modelled properties can be linked to each other. MANGO also enables the origin of the data to be specified.
</body>
    </ownedComment>
